exit door 7 9 w=2 to=back

; Behind the counter: the shelves, the rope and tools on their rack, and a plant.
prop bookshelf 3.5 3.3
prop tool-rack 6 3.2
prop potted-plant 10 3.2
prop bookshelf 12.5 3.3
prop shop-counter 8 6
prop chalkboard 11.2 6.4
npc shopkeeper 8 4.4 name="The Chandler" sheet=trader facing=down say="Rope, wax, lamp oil. Everything a ship needs but the sea.|Candles in every size. Even the big ones.|The east ships stopped buying. The west ones never did."

; The stock, and the candles.
prop crate-stack 2.2 8.2
prop cargo-crate 1.8 6.2
prop book-crate 4 5
prop sacks 12 8.4
prop cargo-barrel 13.9 7
prop barrel-water 13.9 5
prop candle-stand 1.4 4.4
prop candle-stand 14.2 3.6

; A customer.
npc ship-captain 5 6.5 look=405 name="A Ship's Captain" facing=right say="Wax, rope, oil. And the patience to pay for them.|Three weeks to the southern isles, if the wind's honest.|Chandlers are the only honest pirates in this city."

; What the two of you make of the place.
trigger bark-shop-inside 6 7 w=4 h=1 bark=shop-inside
